ormula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={210}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}(x+{210}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}x\\operatorname{cos}{210}^{∘}+\\operatorname{cos}x\\operatorname{sin}{210}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233849 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "48d2ec9c-1478-5b7a-9c37-bf76b5afb790" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232701}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "48d2ec9c-1478-5b7a-9c37-bf76b5afb790" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232701} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c90dba0-28da-5e9d-ac6b-21f47ebf69ee" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232700} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f122872-cbac-53a0-9c20-b6c406801111" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232703}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f122872-cbac-53a0-9c20-b6c406801111" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232703} :answer-field/id #uuid "34b4ba3c-332f-5a3a-9e6a-543e6468b5db" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232702}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6c821975-da43-58e6-b429-87f2ab061604" :question/math-academy-id "q-332176" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{sin}(x-{225}^{∘})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}(x-{225}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}x$" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}u\\operatorname{cos}v-\\operatorname{cos}u\\operatorname{sin}v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={225}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}(x-{225}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}x\\operatorname{cos}{225}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}x\\operatorname{sin}{225}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})-\\operatorname{cos}x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233850 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8bb9f2e-8c32-5ecf-a459-b91280f35c8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232705}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8bb9f2e-8c32-5ecf-a459-b91280f35c8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232705} :answer-field/id #uuid "16cf9844-a456-5a9a-82f4-513ed0384063" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232704} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a6305d7-d3b8-518f-81a9-25db6b7ef3ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186232707